Guidelines for Contributors
Always use plain ASCII for punctuation in code, comments, and documentation.
Avoid pasting text from word processors or web pages directly into code.
Use code linters (e.g., flake8, pylint) with plugins that warn about non-ASCII characters.
Review diffs for unexpected characters before committing.

root = true

[*]
charset = utf-8
end_of_line = lf
insert_final_newline = true
trim_trailing_whitespace = true